<title>USA: Slovenia seeks 30,000 T optional wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Slovenia seeks 30,000 T optional wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia will seek on Wednesday a total of 30,000 tonnes optional origin milling quality wheat, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The estimated arrival date in Slovenia was April 12 and the tender was believed to be private, one exporter said.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
